    <briefdescription>
<para>A split that searches the full-text index files of one index shard, aligned with Java <computeroutput>org.apache.paimon.table.source.IndexFullTextSearchSplit</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When index shards overlap, the scan gives each row to one shard, so a split may rank only some rows of its shard: <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_index_full_text_search_split_1ab57522de54946f96bf51094d5e3b68a4" kindref="member">SearchRowRanges()</ref></computeroutput> lie within [<computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_index_full_text_search_split_1aa98eb23ed721c52532875006ae521d35" kindref="member">RowRangeStart()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_index_full_text_search_split_1aa2aeaa4dcc6647e87edf4323ff0a45f2" kindref="member">RowRangeEnd()</ref></computeroutput>], the physical range of the shard, which maps the shard-local row ids of the index to global ones. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
